---
/* "Salud" (body composition, activity, energy, running, recovery) tab —
 * ported verbatim from the legacy `data-tab="health"` panel in
 * data/nutrition/plan-web.html. Client-rendered entirely by
 * web/src/client/health.js from HEALTH baked by <Bake> (see
 * web/src/tabs/Registro.astro, which hosts the shared Bake call — same
 * pattern already used for Tablas/Hoy/Entrenos, astro-plan-web slice 6).
 *
 * The legacy nav button id is `t-health` (see web/layouts/Plan.astro's
 * `navLabels`) but the tab KEY and panel/host id are `health` (not
 * "salud") — this matches the legacy page exactly (`id="health"`,
 * `setTab('health')`); "Salud" is only the nav LABEL text.
 */
---
<div class="tab-panel" data-tab="health" hidden>
  <div id="health"></div>
</div>
